#ASSERT `s 984(2) the rights are exercisable on the day` (Date 1 10 2027) (Date 30 9 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 984(3): within one month of the end of the acceptance period (31 January: the last day is 28 February).
#ASSERT `s 984(3) the last day for giving the notice` (Date 31 1 2027) EQUALS Date 28 2 2027
#ASSERT `s 984(3) the last day for giving the notice` (Date 30 6 2027) EQUALS Date 30 7 2027
