#ASSERT `s 984(3) the notice has the content the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 984(3) the notice has the content the subsection requires` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 984(3) the notice has the content the subsection requires` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 984(3) the notice has the content the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- s 984(3) as a regulative rule: 31 January to 28 February is 28 days; notice on day 28 is in time, a clock at day 29 with no notice is a breach.
#TRACE `s 984(3) the offeror's duty to give notice` (Date 31 1 2027) AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `s 984 the offeror` DOES `s 984(3) give the shareholder notice of his rights and the period` AT 28

#TRACE `s 984(3) the offeror's duty to give notice` (Date 31 1 2027) AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 29)
